  "details": "Currently, the X on the VRC+ Gift notification makes it seem like you will decline the gift instead of dismissing the notification. It also does not make it obvious that you have VRC+ active before even interacting with the notification.\n\nChanging the X to a checkmark would tell the user visually that they can not decline the gift, as well as confirming and dismissing the notification without making it seem like they are declining it.\nnakos",
